{"3999950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Frozen Echo", "steam_appid": 3999950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frozen Echo is a survival experience set in a frozen wilderness, where you travel with a camp alone or with friends. Learning your skills and trying to withstand harsh cold and wolf packs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build your camp and craft </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999950/extras/1df6258d1b83a8f0e9f40bd44ba8ff5b.poster.avif?t=1787868001\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999950/extras/1df6258d1b83a8f0e9f40bd44ba8ff5b.webm?t=1787868001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999950/extras/1df6258d1b83a8f0e9f40bd44ba8ff5b.mp4?t=1787868001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and upgrade your mobile base so you can craft tools and weapons, survive the coldest nights, and take shelter from wild animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Track, hunt or tame animals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999950/extras/e0108f3d4b98d93275102a6ea16077ea.poster.avif?t=1787868001\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999950/extras/e0108f3d4b98d93275102a6ea16077ea.webm?t=1787868001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999950/extras/e0108f3d4b98d93275102a6ea16077ea.mp4?t=1787868001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track down prey by following its tracks, hunt, tame animals, fight off predators or avoid them. Choose your own survival style and learning the skills you need to overcome any challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Survive in harsh, cold conditions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999950/extras/69e0e0c0d23862a1996c47c898f6e4b7.poster.avif?t=1787868001\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999950/extras/69e0e0c0d23862a1996c47c898f6e4b7.webm?t=1787868001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999950/extras/69e0e0c0d23862a1996c47c898f6e4b7.mp4?t=1787868001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather berries and other food, find ways to survive, stay warm, explore the winter forest, and learn how to avoid attracting the attention of predators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frozen Echo is a survival experience set in a frozen wilderness, where you travel with a camp alone or with friends. Learning your skills and trying to withstand harsh cold and wolf packs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build your camp and craft </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999950/extras/1df6258d1b83a8f0e9f40bd44ba8ff5b.poster.avif?t=1787868001\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://sh